From c3dc8362ae1eeabbbded898151d07aa8117a172a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rohit Goswami <rgoswami@ieee.org>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:15:42 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] add a d-SEAMS module

The molecular dynamics parameter keys are dseams-active,
dseams-input-group, dseams-nstcalc, dseams-cutoff and dseams-output.
The module gathers positions onto one rank and writes a census.
It adds no force. CMake links libyodaLib.
